#
# The Payment Voucher Worksheet for Estimated Tax and Extension Payments
# (PVW) for tax year 2026, though its file name says 2025: who must file a
# declaration, when the payments are due, the 110% of last year's tax, and a
# return filed instead of the fourth payment. The anchors are the
# document's own run-in headings; no page is given, as the copy has not been
# paged.

